{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1219790-akashic-converting-to-the-technocracy","id":1219790,"title":"Akashic converting to the Technocracy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-17T14:25:50-07:00","id":1219790,"title":"Akashic converting to the Technocracy","content":"As the title says, I'm working on a character concept and wondring how to present it and if it is viable at all. <br /> <br /> How would this work, and is it even feasible? How much would their paradigm need to shift, and are there reasonable scientific explanations that could be given for Akashic abilities to smooth the way? What would the Akashic lose for this process? Could they still retain and use Do?<br /> <br /> On another note, what merits and flaws could represent this? Probationary sect-member, and Scientific Mystic/Tech-Gnosi come to mind, but are there any others?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12093-pixelpuzzler","name":"PixelPuzzler","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T14:41:02-07:00","id":1219796,"title":"","content":"That's actually realtively simple.<br /> Do itself is not supernatural. It *was* developed over a long time by enlightened minds able to boost their mental abilities to develop such an absolutely perfected ability - but it can even be taught to a sleeper. Doesn't (probably) happen, as it being taught to a non-Akashic Mage is already extremely rare - but there you go. Do can definitely be kept.<br /> <br /> As for the rest of an Akashic's physical feats that actually require Magick, the Technocracy has similiar trainings and regiments. Especially the NWO's Black Suits undergo close combat training that makes use of their enlightened abilities to deliver harder punches, faster punches, aggravated damage nad a supernatural overview of the battlefield. They simply attribute this to the study of enlightened principles and techniques. So that can be kept as well - it is simply the reasoning behind it that might shift a little, and probably not even *that* much. Discipline of mind and body.<br /> <br /> The Mind abilities of an Akashic? Here comes the NWO again. They are all about Social Dominion, psychological infuence, emotional reading and mind tricks. Again, the reasoning behind the principles might shift - from something less exoteric, to something...'Scientific'.<br /> <br /> <br /> Regarding all this, the NWO would actually be a quite good fit for an Akashic. The Tradition and Convention are like two sides of a coin when it comes to mental and physical discipline.<br /> What would definitely change is the outlook on the Great Wheel, reincarnation and karma. That is the part that would definitely need to undergo the most...therapy.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T14:44:22-07:00","id":1219797,"title":"","content":"As ever, a lot of this depends on the individual paradigm of the mage. They might be a mind of matter type, but they might also be a ruthless capitalist at heart, and though they practice meditation, martial arts, a strict diet, live very minimalisticaly, and other arts of Do, they also happen to own a thriving business. They might not do it for the money, but the thrill of the control that such an endeavour creates, and the pure love of the process itself. This would make them hearty pickings for the syndicate, especially with so many companies vying for the Chinese market these days.<br /> <br /> Hiwever, perhaps they are more interested in using their mastery over poetry and calligraphy, and the way the written word can be used to influence and inspire, this leads them to wish to study such topics and may in fact be drawn towards the academics for the NWO, who literally wrote the book on how to use words for influence.<br /> <br /> Or maybe they were betrayed, their master left them, abandoned them at a crucial point, and left them for dead, and instead they were rescued by those they thought their enemy. Any member of the technocracy can fit in for this role, they can start as a contact, and grow into a much stronger bond as they share their experiences. Maybe they even begin to see what their masters have taught them of the technocracy as slander designed to keep them reliant on the old ways. Sure there as distinct truths that the akashic teachings have provided, but perhaps the technocracy are using the very same truths to attain their abilities. Perhaps there\u2019s more to them than the facade. Perhaps their akashic masters are too quick to dismiss all technocrats as a faceless mass of evil, and this guy has learned more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}